    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">forðam on manegum landum tilð bið redre ðonne on oðrum . ge yrðe tima hrædra . ge mæde mæda rædran ge winterdun eac swa . ge gehwilc oðer tilð</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">because on some lands duties are ready (earlier) than on others, earlier ploughing times, earlier mowing, earlier winter pasturage likewise, and each other task.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[1.1] forðam on manegum landum tilð bið redre ðonne on oðrum: ge yrðe tima hrædra, ge mæda rædran, ge winterdún eac swa, ge gehwilc oðer tilð.</ab>
      </div>
